     2099   DEFINE FRAME InfoFrame
     2100        StopBtn AT ROW 4.25 COL 21.75
     2101        RecordsString AT ROW 1.21 COL 2 NO-LABEL
     2102        RecordsString2 AT ROW 1.96 COL 2 NO-LABEL
     2103        RecordsString3 AT ROW 2.58 COL 2 NO-LABEL
     2104        RecordsDone AT ROW 3.42 COL 24.88 COLON-ALIGNED
     2105        RECT-1 AT ROW 1 COL 1
     2106       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
